"w_email":{"title":"Smeþa email","desc":"Lim ruh email, sege hwam hit sy and hu hit hlydan scyle, and Claude hit edhiwaþ oþ þæt þu hit geþafige.","tip":"Fanda earfoþe: ungolden gafol eft biddan, oþþe est forsacan."},
"w_story":{"title":"Slæpspell mid sceawere","desc":"Writ liþe spell for sumum cilde, and sceawaþ siþþan þæt hit sy ylde gedafenlic, stille and na to lang.","tip":"Wend þa sceawunge regolas, swa “hæfþ rim” oþþe “tæcþ dælan”."},
