"w_llama":{"title":"Llama writ, Claude sceawaþ","desc":"Llama bysen on þinum agenum rimcræfte writ þæt frumgewrit and þa edworhtan; Claude sceawaþ ælce fadunge be þinum regolum.","tip":"Llama andswaraþ ana on utgelæddum Python (mid Ollama yrnendum); on þam leafe Claude stent for him."},
"w_judges":{"title":"Six CG demaþ","desc":"Claude, Gemini, Llama, DeepSeek, Grok and GPT demaþ ælc þin gewrit of 10; þu onfehst ealra six doma and þæs midlenes.","tip":"Lim heafodword, cypinge asecgunge oþþe spelles fruman."},
"r_brief":{"title":"Smeaunge scortgewrit","desc":"Todælþ þinne intingan on 4 axunga, andswaraþ ælcre, and sceawaþ siþþan þæt eall þæt gewrit sy efen and soþfæst be uncuþum.","tip":"Fanda “Is rygen melu betere for beorman þonne hwit melu?”"},
"r_compare":{"title":"Wiþmet cyras","desc":"Asetteþ god, yfel and hwam ælc cyre gedafenaþ, demeþ hie, and tealþ þone betstan ærest.","tip":"Fanda “þreo hlafmelu”, “twegen bærrimcræftas” oþþe “restdagas on Cornwealum oþþe on Meregum”."},
