"r_second":{"title":"Oþer dom fram DeepSeek","desc":"Claude and DeepSeek andswariaþ þære ylcan axunge on sundron; siþþan Claude wiþmet þa twa and ætywþ hwær hie ungelice sind.","tip":"Ungelicnessa sind þær þu deoppor delfan scealt oþþe æwielm sceawian."},
"w_gptcheck":{"title":"Claude writ, GPT sceawaþ","desc":"Claude writ gewrit, OpenAI GPT secþ hol on him, and Claude hit edwrit to betanne ælc þing þe GPT arærde.","tip":"Oþres hades bysen gesihþ þæt þe seo forme ne gesihþ. Fanda hit on gewrite for þegnunge."},
