"w_worldpanel":{"title":"Geþohtas geond middangeard","desc":"Mistral (Francland), Qwen (Alibaba), Kimi (Moonshot), GLM (Z.ai) and MiniMax beodaþ ælc geþoht; Claude geceosþ þæt strangeste and segþ forhwi.","tip":"Bysena getyde on ungelicum stowum habbaþ soþlice ungelic gecynd. Fanda naman cypinge, oþþe gebeorscipes intingan."},
"w_groqstorm":{"title":"Swift ymbgang mid Groq","desc":"Groqes swiþe swift open bysen ageotaþ 20 ruh geþohtas on eagan bryhtme; Claude geceosþ siþþan þa fif betstan and hie smeþaþ.","tip":"Undyre, swifte bysena sind gode for menigeo; wær bysen is betere to geceosenne. Fanda gewrita heafodword."},
"c_openonly":{"title":"Ana opene bysena (Hugging Face)","desc":"Gemma 4 writ andsware and GPT-OSS hie sceawaþ. Ægþer is open bysen, yrnende þurh Hugging Face, forþy nan Claude ne biþ gebroced.","tip":"Nytt to wiþmetenne opene bysena wiþ Claude. Wend þa bysena naman on þam utgelæddan fætelse to ælcre bysene on huggingface.co."},
