"r_survey":{"title":"Efene ascunge axunga","desc":"Writ ascunge axunga, demeþ ælce for efennesse and sweotolnesse, and edwrit þa wacan.","tip":"Lytla oþþe hebb þone domes þerscwold (7) on þam geolwreadan stocce “gif”."},
