"r_pdf_notes":{"title":"Leorninge gemearc of gewrite","desc":"Ateohþ þa heafodþing of gewrite, tealþ þa axunga þe hit open læt, and hylt notes.md.","tip":"Wyrcþ wel mid boclicum gewritum and langum gewritum gehealdenum swa PDF."},
