"d_logo":{"title":"Tacnes geþohtas, se betsta gehealden","desc":"Atyfreþ þreo tacnes geþohtas for þinum hade, demeþ ælc, and hylt þone betstan.","tip":"Asege þone mod þe þu wilt, na ana þone naman."},
