"d_wireframes":{"title":"Teoh tolscirmas","desc":"Wendeþ tolgeþoht to his þrim nytwyrþestan scirmum, mid anfealdre wirtimbrunge ælces.","tip":"Asege þin geþoht on anum cwide, swa “tol to weardienne mines beorman fedinga”."},
"d_palette":{"title":"Bleoa getæl of mode","desc":"Macaþ fif bleoa getæl mid hex code of mode oþþe stowe, and atyfreþ siþþan þa bysena.","tip":"Fanda “bæcern on dægred” oþþe “sæwaroþes cumhus on wintra”."},
"d_icons":{"title":"Gelic tacna gesetu","desc":"Stande lar hylt ælce atyfrunge on anre wisan, þæt fif tacnu cumen ut swa gelic geset.","tip":"Wend þa wisan on þam lare stocce: bleo, linan þicnesse, full oþþe ymbtogen."},
"d_name":{"title":"Nama, cwide and forma tacn","desc":"Forðbringþ fif naman mid cwidum, læt þe geceosan ænne, and atyfreþ siþþan forme tacn for him.","tip":"Bruc hit for cypinge, gilde, cypinge þinge oþþe hobbweorce."},
"l_quiz":{"title":"Maca axunga plegan","desc":"Writ fif axunga mid cyrum be ælcum intingan, mid rihtre andsware gemearcodre, and hylt quiz.md.","tip":"Sege hwam hit sy: “þa Tudoras, for fiftan geare” oþþe “beorming, for ealdum”."},
